commit 351b04cb
author: 钛白
date: 2026-10-23 12:01:37 +0700
subject: feat(provider): add SenseNova provider support

Introduce support for the SenseNova provider, including image options
and configuration settings.

- Register SenseNova provider and models (sensenova-6.8-flash-lite, U1.5 image models, etc.)
- Extend OpenAI image adapter for watermark, prompt_extend, and output_format
- Add boolean option support in GenericExampleCard
- Add test connection validation for SenseNova (#5079)


